{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/25803cd3534360b9fbc6c5629e299fed.avif?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of park manager and design the ultimate zoo for nature's greatest creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, incubate and release dozens of extinct species to build a successful park that can keep up with the growing demands of guests, staff and hungry animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/2a13d6e0f38c9179ba4a2ea36c32983c.webp?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/5bd5c0aa17d178409cd702077b8bfcf6.avif?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the majestic Woolly Mammoth to the mighty Spinosaurus, undo the rules of extinction by reviving a diverse selection of over 50 species of prehistoric wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as they seamlessly grow from baby to adult; changing their proportions, sounds and behaviors in realtime. They'll need to eat, drink, sleep and satisfy their social needs through dynamic behaviors like herding and socialization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/dbae52c84936b9308347a22faeca3226.avif?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/53afa7dd82fd35541160bf6a41e3428a.avif?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design  stunning parks across an enormous playable area to draw in crowds from all over the world. Carve rivers, raise mountains or build facilities piece-by-piece with precise creative tools.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of themed prefabs or use the Steam Workshop to share or download ready-made structures like restaurants, toilets and viewing platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/2a13d6e0f38c9179ba4a2ea36c32983c.webp?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/8ba2509f5d8aaa98864e860c297d448c.avif?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your zoo with logistics management, strategically placing key infrastructure  to optimize its efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import or generate resources and deliver them throughout the zoo with trainable staff to\u00a0ensure your kiosks and feeders remain stocked. Don't forget to clean those dung piles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/2a13d6e0f38c9179ba4a2ea36c32983c.webp?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/662e0e45533db831d9288019ab66ed94.avif?t=1770909825\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get up close and personal with <strong>First Person Mode</strong> and explore your zoo from a different persective. Take a look through binoculars, enter habitats or even stop to sit  on a bench with this immersive and interactive mode. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"90b7793413d87e0cd945909df023b2c0bcfd7317.jpg","localized_name":"Spared Every Expense","name":"Spared Every Expense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/90b7793413d87e0cd945909df023b2c0bcfd7317.jpg"},{"icon":"e2b99fb1558db906afff30013f4ed587ff3c736f.jpg","localized_name":"Crowds o' Plenty","name":"Crowds o' Plenty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/e2b99fb1558db906afff30013f4ed587ff3c736f.jpg"},{"icon":"b20d074138f15f6f8aeda8bfa8586947bb90eb01.jpg","localized_name":"Tycoon","name":"Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/b20d074138f15f6f8aeda8bfa8586947bb90eb01.jpg"},{"icon":"963a7dcf85cbb6bae6ba4bcfe0131aeeff0c2277.jpg","localized_name":"Fossil Record","name":"Fossil Record","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/963a7dcf85cbb6bae6ba4bcfe0131aeeff0c2277.jpg"},{"icon":"9d43b26f8fc68ec5b975cab2eef268ce99c04c11.jpg","localized_name":"Hatchling","name":"Hatchling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/9d43b26f8fc68ec5b975cab2eef268ce99c04c11.jpg"},{"icon":"13c65cffe960d6d65b8860beb09a9ffe346da832.jpg","localized_name":"Noah's Park","name":"Noah's Park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/13c65cffe960d6d65b8860beb09a9ffe346da832.jpg"},{"icon":"3edda098538d31490972d8996bb5d20111bd653a.jpg","localized_name":"Sabre-Toothed Cat","name":"Sabre-Toothed Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/666150/3edda098538d31490972d8996bb5d20111bd653a.jpg"